{"seq":2,"slug":"ethics-research","title":"伦理学研究","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/ethics-research","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"伦理学研究-简介\">伦理学研究 简介</h1><p>伦理学研究系统考察道德判断的基础、规范行为的原则以及伦理思考在具体领域中的应用。对于研究生而言，伦理学素养既是人文社科学术训练的核心组成部分，也是开展任何涉及人类参与者研究时不可或缺的底层认知。</p>\n<p>本课程从元伦理学的根基性问题出发，经由规范伦理学的三大理论传统和应用伦理学的当代议题，最终聚焦于科研伦理的实践要求，共设四个章节。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>元伦理学</strong>追问道德判断的性质和基础。道德实在论探讨客观道德事实是否存在，情感主义与表达主义从非认知立场重新诠释道德语言的功能，道德相对主义则质疑跨文化道德标准的可能性。这些基础性探讨为后续的规范讨论提供认识论前提。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>规范伦理学</strong>呈现三种最具影响力的道德理论。后果主义以行为结果衡量道德价值，义务论伦理学强调行为本身的道德属性，德性伦理学将关注焦点从行为转向行为者的品格。理解这三种视角的内在逻辑和相互张力是伦理分析的基本功。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>应用伦理学</strong>将理论框架带入三个充满现实争议的领域。生命伦理学面对的是生死与医疗技术的道德困境，环境伦理学重新审视人与自然的伦理关系，技术伦理学则回应人工智能和数字技术带来的新兴道德挑战。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>科研伦理</strong>直接关系到每位研究生的学术实践。知情同意的规范要求、科研诚信的底线原则以及发表伦理中的署名和数据共享问题，都是维护学术共同体信任的关键制度。</p>\n<p>建议学习者在理论章节中培养伦理分析能力，在应用和科研伦理章节中将其转化为实际判断力。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"meta-ethics","title":"元伦理学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/ethics-research/meta-ethics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"moral-realism","title":"研究生 伦理学研究 — 道德实在论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/ethics-research/meta-ethics/moral-realism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"emotivism-expressivism","title":"研究生 伦理学研究 — 情感主义与表达主义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/ethics-research/meta-ethics/emotivism-expressivism"},{"seq":3,"slug":"moral-relativism","title":"研究生 伦理学研究 — 道德相对主义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/ethics-research/meta-ethics/moral-relativism"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"normative-ethics","title":"规范伦理学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/ethics-research/normative-ethics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"consequentialism","title":"研究生 伦理学研究 — 后果主义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/ethics-research/normative-ethics/consequentialism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"deontological-ethics","title":"研究生 伦理学研究 — 义务论伦理学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/ethics-research/normative-ethics/deontological-ethics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"virtue-ethics","title":"研究生 伦理学研究 — 德性伦理学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/ethics-research/normative-ethics/virtue-ethics"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"applied-ethics","title":"应用伦理学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/ethics-research/applied-ethics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"bioethics","title":"研究生 伦理学研究 — 生命伦理学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/ethics-research/applied-ethics/bioethics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"environmental-ethics","title":"研究生 伦理学研究 — 环境伦理学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/ethics-research/applied-ethics/environmental-ethics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"technology-ethics","title":"研究生 伦理学研究 — 技术伦理学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/ethics-research/applied-ethics/technology-ethics"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"research-ethics","title":"科研伦理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/ethics-research/research-ethics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"informed-consent","title":"研究生 伦理学研究 — 知情同意","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/ethics-research/research-ethics/informed-consent"},{"seq":2,"slug":"research-integrity","title":"研究生 伦理学研究 — 科研诚信","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/ethics-research/research-ethics/research-integrity"},{"seq":3,"slug":"publication-ethics","title":"研究生 伦理学研究 — 发表伦理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/philosophy/ethics-research/research-ethics/publication-ethics"}]}]}